the target language is: prolog. 
    
the templates are:

*a subclass* is a class of *a super class*.
  
the contract states that:

% A CGT asset is:
% (a) any kind of property; or
% (b) a legal or equitable right that is not property.

a thing is a class of CGT asset
  if the thing is a class of property
  or    the thing is a class of legal right
        or the thing is a class of equitable right
    and it is not the case that
        the thing is a class of property. 

scenario class is:
    money is a class of property. 
    one expects ["money is a class of property", "money is a class of CGT asset"]. 

query one is:
    which thing is a class of which type.